---
import PhoneVideo from "./PhoneVideo.astro";
import StoreBadges from "./StoreBadges.astro";
---

<div class="flex w-full max-w-[1200px] flex-col justify-between lg:flex-row">
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 lg:max-w-sm">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">WordTree</h2>
		<p>
			<a href="https://www.wordtree.app" class="underline" target="_blank"
				>WordTree</a
			> is a word puzzle played one letter at a time. Players fill a tree of
			five rows, from a one-letter word at the top to a five-letter word at
			the bottom, without knowing which letter comes next.
		</p>
		<p>
			First built in 2023 as an experiment in cross-platform development,
			the original grew to over 1,000 active users. In 2026 I did a
			ground-up rewrite for iOS and Android with a shared Daily Puzzle, an
			Endless mode, live head-to-head duels, verified leaderboards, and
			replays.
		</p>
		<p>
			Under the hood, a deterministic TypeScript engine runs unmodified on
			the phone and in a Cloudflare Worker, so the server can replay every
			move to verify scores. That one property powers the anti-cheat,
			multiplayer fairness, and replays. Give it a try!
		</p>
		<StoreBadges
			name="WordTree"
			appStore="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wordtree-a-daily-word-puzzle/id6446817670"
			googlePlay="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hdwatts.wordtree"
		/>
	</div>
	<div class="flex justify-center p-8 lg:flex-1 lg:p-16">
		<PhoneVideo
			href="https://www.wordtree.app"
			src="/video/wordtree-preview.mp4"
			poster="/video/wordtree-preview-poster.jpg"
			label="Play WordTree"
		/>
	</div>
</div>
